flowchart TD
    A([Publish starts]) --> B[Client publishes RTMP through public Proxy Service]
    B --> C[Proxy receives stream]
    C --> D[on_publish_start.sh notifies POST /streams/started]
    D --> E[Controller logs event and returns started_event_processed]
    E --> F([Publish continues])
    F --> G[on_publish_done.sh notifies POST /streams/ended]
    G --> H[Controller logs event and returns ended]
    H --> I([End])

    W[No retained ownership or Worker lifecycle state]:::note
    D -. cleanup-phase boundary .-> W
    classDef note fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#856404,color:#533f03
